{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：10:29 2026-11-27 HKT<br/>發佈時間：10:29 2026-11-27 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：10:29 2026-11-27 HKT</p><img alt=\"劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/edc45ed5e77ce22235b0e558812aced5/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-27_at_10_18_26_1_.jpeg\"/><p>今(27日)早上9時25分，青衣路對開海域發生撞船意外，一艘往來上環與蛇口的船隻，駛至青衣油庫附近,，據報撞向船塢設施，船上至少24人受傷，其中4人較嚴重，救援人員正趕往現場營救，並將船隻拖到友聯船廠，將傷者送上岸然後送院救治。</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e965bd816915b258b13c15bb3560a708/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-27_at_10_18_26.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8842f829a6129f4f24baa49f580390ec/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-27_at_10_18_25_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9b98af8c5ff685214b2c4f01a3e8ac89/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-27_at_10_18_25.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T02:43:54.913734+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":197,"images":4,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T02:29:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T02:37:29.420393+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T02:37:29.420393+00:00","content_hash":"4bcc0de536dec7fecdc4d9f74ce1cff50f15b745e0e2e074ed83d76a2e2b5797","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}